      en: ["The Residence Act of 1790 approved the creation of a national capital.", "The Washington Monument stands at 555 feet (169 meters) tall.", "D.C. has no voting representation in the U.S. Senate or House of Representatives.", "The cherry blossom trees around the Tidal Basin were a gift from Japan in 1912.", "Over 20 million tourists visit Washington, D.C. each year.", "The cornerstone of the White House was laid in 1792."],
