      en: ["Memphis was founded in 1819 and incorporated as a city in 1826.", "Beale Street was declared a National Historic Landmark in 1977.", "Memphis International Airport has consistently been the world's busiest cargo airport since the 1990s.", "St. Jude Children's Research Hospital, founded in 1962, treats children at no cost.", "The Memphis Pyramid, originally a sports arena, now houses a massive Bass Pro Shops store.", "Shelby Farms Park in Memphis is one of the largest urban parks in the United States."],
      es: ["Fundada en 1819 a orillas del río Misisipi", "Cuna del rock 'n' roll y epicentro del blues (Beale Street)", "Graceland es la residencia histórica más visitada del mundo", "Importante centro logístico internacional (Sede de FedEx)", "El National Civil Rights Museum está en el lugar del asesinato de Martin Luther King Jr.", "Centro cultural y económico en el Misisipi"],
      pt: ["Fundada em 1819 no Rio Mississippi", "Berço do rock 'n' roll e epicentro do blues (Beale Street)", "Graceland é a residência histórica mais visitada do mundo", "Importante centro logístico internacional (Sede da FedEx)", "O National Civil Rights Museum situa-se no local do assassinato de Martin Luther King Jr.", "Centro cultural e económico no Mississippi"],
      fr: ["Fondée en 1819 sur le fleuve Mississippi", "Berceau du rock 'n' roll et épicentre du blues (Beale Street)", "Graceland est la demeure historique la plus visitée au monde", "Centre logistique international majeur (Siège de FedEx)", "Le National Civil Rights Museum se trouve sur le lieu de l'assassinat de Martin Luther King Jr.", "Centre culturel et économique sur le Mississippi"],
