      en: ["Founded in 1849 and became the state capital in 1854.", "The city's population was approximately 524,943 as of the 2020 census.", "Sacramento serves as a major deep-water port connected to the San Francisco Bay.", "Home to the largest urban forest in the U.S. per capita.", "The California State Capitol building is modeled after the U.S. Capitol.", "Sacramento is the sunniest place on Earth from June to September.", "The city covers a total area of 100.1 square miles.", "The American River Parkway is a 32-mile long multi-use trail."],
