      en: ["The city was incorporated in 1873.", "The name 'Plano' comes from the Spanish word for 'flat,' describing the local topography.", "Plano was named an All-America City in 1981.", "Plano is often ranked as one of the safest cities in the United States.", "Headquarters for companies like Toyota Motor North America, Frito-Lay, and J.C. Penney.", "The annual Plano Balloon Festival draws tens of thousands of visitors."],
