      en: ["Montana State Capitol", "Reeder's Alley, a historic district", "Gates of the Mountains, a river canyon", "Near the Continental Divide"],
      es: ["Montana State Capitol", "Reeder's Alley, un barrio histórico", "Gates of the Mountains, un cañón fluvial", "Cerca de la divisoria continental"],
